# Noticias — no duplicate stories

When adding curated `/noticias/` posts from external sources:

- **One story, one post.** Do not create a second noticia for the same event, collection launch, exhibition, or auction just because another outlet covered it.
- **Different source ≠ new story.** Skip the URL unless it adds material facts the existing post lacks (prices, dates, species list, venues, official names, corrections).
- **If new facts appear**, update the existing noticia (and cite the additional source in the body or related links) instead of publishing a parallel summary.
- **Before writing**, search `src/content/noticias/` for the same subject (institution, collection name, event, country + theme).
